# Ball Pit scripted session: every mechanic, then ten fingers at once.
# a tap in empty space: three balls drop from the beam, playing a little tune
tap   15 0 300 150
# a tap on the pile: the balls around it hop up
tap   55 1 560 420
# one finger sweeps through the pile, a second one comes back the other way
drag  75 60 0 150 430 800 400
drag 100 60 1 820 330 160 360
# a hold in empty space pours balls slowly
hold 150 80 2 700 130
# a finger circles over the heap
wave 160 70 3 480 380 130 1.5
# ten fingers at once: random drags
fuzz 220 80 10
